  "0db8e9ba-4f3f-4d81-87af-d7472f61415e": {
   "name": "The data behind IPCC AR6 SYR Figure 2.1",
   "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
   "visible": true,
   "parameters": {
    "zoom": 1.4,
    "extent": [
     -34478035.576546915,
     -20223937.14614873,
     36704425.39241239,
     27231036.833157476
    ],
    "content": {
     "contentMode": "markdown",
     "title": "The data behind IPCC AR6 SYR Figure 2.1",
     "markdown": "## One IPCC figure, four data tiers\n\n**IPCC AR6 Synthesis Report · Longer Report · Figure 2.1**\n*The causal chain from emissions to resulting warming.*\n\nThis story walks the figure back to its data, in the order the IPCC Data Distribution Centre (DDC) organises it:\n\n| Step | Question |\n|---|---|\n| **1 · Report** | What does the figure show, and which Working-Group figures is it built from? |\n| **2 · Input data** | Which observations, inventories and simulations did authors start from? |\n| **3 · Intermediate data** | What was computed along the way, and where is it archived? |\n| **4 · Final data** | Which numbers are plotted, and can I download them today? |\n\nEach stop shows one status badge:\n\n* 🟢 **AVAILABLE** – copy in this project, loaded live from the archive when online\n* 🔵 **ONLINE** – published, link only (not re-hosted here)\n* 🟡 **PARTIAL** – exists but incomplete or not verifiable from here\n* 🔴 **MISSING** – no record exists\n\n➡ **Next** – Step 1: the figure itself.",
     "image": ""
    },
    "layerOverride": [],
    "transition": {
     "type": "smooth",
     "time": 2.0
    }
   }
  },
  "2f16ce4e-0ebf-4e97-97f6-4f3358edf4b5": {
   "name": "Step 1 · The report: Figure 2.1 and its four panels",
   "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
   "visible": true,
   "parameters": {
    "zoom": 11.5,
    "extent": [
     651072.1888501821,
     5794376.870463113,
     715931.1580912173,
     5837616.183290469
    ],
    "content": {
     "contentMode": "map",
     "title": "Step 1 · The report: Figure 2.1 and its four panels",
     "markdown": "🔵 **ONLINE** – published, link only (not re-hosted here)\n\n**Climate Change 2023: Synthesis Report** – approved 19 March 2023, Geneva.\ndoi:10.59327/IPCC/AR6-9789291691647 · [figure page](https://www.ipcc.ch/report/ar6/syr/figures/figure-2-1)\n\nThe caption's traceability tag names the sources:\n`{WGI SPM A.2.2, WGI Figure SPM.1, WGI Figure SPM.2, WGI TS2.2, WGI 2.1; WGIII Figure SPM.1, WGIII A.III.II.2.5.1}`\n\n| Panel | Built from |\n|---|---|\n| **(a)** GHG emissions 1990–2019 by gas | WGIII Figure SPM.1 |\n| **(b)** CO₂ · CH₄ · N₂O concentrations, annual, panel heights ∝ warming effect | WGI Section 2.1 (Figures 2.4, 2.5) + SPM.2(c) |\n| **(c)** Global surface temperature vs 1850–1900, with the warmest period of the last 100 000 yr | WGI Figure SPM.1 |\n| **(d)** Warming 1850–1900 → 2010–2019 by driver | WGI Figure SPM.2 |\n\nThe SYR re-publishes Working-Group data, so Steps 2–4 follow the WGI and WGIII records.\n\n➡ **Next** – how the IPCC organises its data.",
     "image": ""
    },
    "layerOverride": [],
    "transition": {
     "type": "smooth",
     "time": 2.0
    }
   }
  },
  "60ffed2d-93d9-4c4c-979a-5a77279a81fd": {
   "name": "Step 1 · How the IPCC organises data",
   "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
   "visible": true,
   "parameters": {
    "zoom": 1.4,
    "extent": [
     -34478035.576546915,
     -20223937.14614873,
     36704425.39241239,
     27231036.833157476
    ],
    "content": {
     "contentMode": "markdown",
     "title": "Step 1 · How the IPCC organises data",
     "markdown": "## Three tiers, five archives\n\n| Tier | What it is → where it lives (AR6) |\n|---|---|\n| **Input data** | observations, inventories, model runs the authors started from → CMIP6 subset at **DKRZ**; observations stay with the producing networks |\n| **Intermediate data** | products authors created while processing inputs → **DKRZ** `IPCC-DDC_AR6_Supplements`, **CSIC** Atlas, chapter-level records at **CEDA** |\n| **Final data** | the numbers plotted in a published figure → WGI/WGII **CEDA** · WGIII **IPCC Data Catalogue** · SYR **CIESIN / SEDAC** |\n\nDOI prefixes: DKRZ `10.26050/WDCC/AR6.*` · CEDA `10.5285/*` · IPCC Data Catalogue `10.48490/*` · SEDAC `10.7927/*`\n\n### Status of Figure 2.1 today\n\n| Tier → panel | (a) emissions | (b) concentr. | (c) temperature | (d) attribution |\n|---|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|\n| **1** Report (ipcc.ch) | 🔵 | 🔵 | 🔵 | 🔵 |\n| **2** Input · DDC at DKRZ (CMIP6) | – | – | 🔵 | 🔵 |\n| **2** Input · originating institutions | 🔵 | 🔵 | 🟢 | 🔵 |\n| **3** Intermediate · chapter records at CEDA | 🟡 | 🟢 | 🟢 | 🟢 |\n| **4** Final · Working Group record | 🟢 | 🟢 | 🟢 | 🟢 |\n| **4** Final · SYR record (SEDAC) | 🔴 | 🔴 | 🟡 | 🟡 |\n\n🟢 available · 🔵 online · 🟡 partial · 🔴 missing · checked 2026-10-13\n\n\n➡ **Next** – Step 2: the input data.",
     "image": ""
    },
    "layerOverride": [],
    "transition": {
     "type": "smooth",
     "time": 2.0
    }
   }
  },
  "5fb69d74-2da9-4f43-9600-55eec50fadc6": {
   "name": "Step 2 · Input data – overview",
   "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
   "visible": true,
   "parameters": {
    "zoom": 4.2,
    "extent": [
     -4665170.525557168,
     2953165.081767911,
     5555726.451903356,
     9767096.400074927
    ],
    "content": {
     "contentMode": "markdown",
     "title": "Step 2 · Input data – overview",
     "markdown": "## Step 2 · What the authors started from\n\nThe DDC re-hosts **model** input (DKRZ). **Observational** input is cited to the producing institution, not copied.\nOne exception helps us here: CEDA publishes an *Input data for Figure 2.11* record – the four temperature datasets behind panel (c).\n\n| Panel | Input datasets |\n|---|---|\n| **(a)** | 🔵 EDGAR v6.0 (JRC) · CO₂-LULUCF from BLUE, Houghton & Nassikas, OSCAR · harmonised in Minx et al. 2021 (Zenodo) |\n| **(b)** | 🔵 NOAA GML, Scripps, CSIRO, AGAGE, UCI network means · ice cores (Law Dome, WAIS, EDML) for pre-1958 |\n| **(c)** | 🟢 HadCRUT5, NOAAGlobalTemp, Berkeley Earth, Kadow 2020 (CEDA input record) · 🔵 PAGES 2k · CMIP6 at DKRZ |\n| **(d)** | 🔵 HadCRUT4.6 · CMIP6 DAMIP hist-GHG / hist-aer / hist-nat at DKRZ |\n\nDetailed source tables: `data/input/README.md`.\n\n➡ **Next** – the DDC input archive at DKRZ, then six places where inputs are made.",
     "image": ""
    },
    "layerOverride": [],
    "transition": {
     "type": "smooth",
     "time": 2.0
    }
   }
  },
  "ff6baf27-f3ba-48fa-a09f-e335d919613a": {
   "name": "Step 2 · DKRZ Hamburg – the CMIP6 input archive",
   "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
   "visible": true,
   "parameters": {
    "zoom": 11.5,
    "extent": [
     1078539.0334963528,
     7067141.857122083,
     1143398.002737388,
     7110381.169949439
    ],
    "content": {
     "contentMode": "map",
     "title": "Step 2 · DKRZ Hamburg – the CMIP6 input archive",
     "markdown": "🔵 **ONLINE** – published, link only (not re-hosted here)\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| **Archive** | World Data Center for Climate (WDCC), project `IPCC-AR6_CMIP6` |\n| **Content** | CMIP6 subset used by WGI authors: **65 118 datasets**, ~120 models |\n| **Granularity** | one entry per model × experiment, e.g. doi:10.26050/WDCC/AR6.C6CMCASFGO |\n| **Used in Fig 2.1** | panel (c) model envelopes (historical + ssp245, hist-nat) · panel (d) attribution runs (hist-GHG, hist-aer, hist-nat) |\n| **Licence** | CC BY 4.0 |\n| **Link** | [wdc-climate.de → IPCC-AR6_CMIP6](https://www.wdc-climate.de/ui/project?acronym=IPCC-AR6_CMIP6) |\n\n➡ **Next** – CSIC-IFCA, the second DDC input/intermediate node.",
     "image": ""
    },
    "layerOverride": [],
    "transition": {
     "type": "smooth",
     "time": 2.0
    }
   }
  },
  "522356e0-dfbb-40b8-9630-4a6d204a66f1": {
   "name": "Step 2 · CSIC-IFCA Santander – Atlas inputs",
   "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
   "visible": true,
   "parameters": {
    "zoom": 11.5,
    "extent": [
     -455888.8275981303,
     5362320.203168563,
     -391029.858357095,
     5405559.515995919
    ],
    "content": {
     "contentMode": "map",
     "title": "Step 2 · CSIC-IFCA Santander – Atlas inputs",
     "markdown": "🔵 **ONLINE** – published, link only (not re-hosted here)\n\n* Hosts the WGI **Interactive Atlas** and, with DKRZ, the DDC long-term archive for input and intermediate data.\n* Same observational and CMIP6 inputs, aggregated **regionally**.\n* Figure 2.1 is global, so no Atlas product feeds it directly.\n* Useful for regional versions of panels (c) and (d).\n\n[interactive-atlas.ipcc.ch](https://interactive-atlas.ipcc.ch)\n\n➡ **Next** – Mauna Loa, where the CO₂ record starts.",
     "image": ""
    },
    "layerOverride": [],
    "transition": {
     "type": "smooth",
     "time": 2.0
    }
   }
  },
  "de1d8540-d669-4284-b916-30b0e6adb6cb": {
   "name": "Step 2 · Mauna Loa – CO₂ since 1958 (panel b)",
   "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
   "visible": true,
   "parameters": {
    "zoom": 11.5,
    "extent": [
     -17351103.98012209,
     2196547.976594136,
