     6916319.4576961
    ],
    "content": {
     "contentMode": "map",
     "title": "Step 2 · Berlin – the harmonised emissions workbook (panel a)",
     "markdown": "🔵 **ONLINE** – published, link only (not re-hosted here)\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| **Paper** | Minx, Lamb, Andrew et al. (2021) ESSD 13, 5213–5252 · doi:10.5194/essd-13-5213-2021 |\n| **Data** | Zenodo **doi:10.5281/zenodo.6483002** · `essd_ghg_data_gwp100.xlsx` (196 639 rows) · `essd_lulucf_data.xlsx` |\n| **Code** | github.com/mcc-apsis/AR6-Emissions-trends-and-drivers (R) |\n| **In project** | global totals by gas rebuilt by `scripts/build_wgiii_spm1_from_essd.py` → **59.1 Gt CO₂-eq in 2019**, +54 % vs 1990 |\n| **Licence** | CC BY 4.0 |\n\n➡ **Next** – Step 3: the intermediate data.",
     "image": ""
    },
    "layerOverride": [],
    "transition": {
     "type": "smooth",
     "time": 2.0
    }
   }
  },
  "c1c290e7-e378-4da3-982e-71fb53f5e2bc": {
   "name": "Step 3 · Intermediate data – overview",
   "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
   "visible": true,
