    ],
    "content": {
     "contentMode": "markdown",
     "title": "Step 3 · Intermediate data – overview",
     "markdown": "## Step 3 · What was computed along the way\n\nNo record is labelled \"intermediate data for SYR Figure 2.1\". The processing chain is visible instead in\n**chapter-level WGI records at CEDA**, now bundled here and loadable live from `dap.ceda.ac.uk`:\n\n| Panel | Chapter-level record (CEDA, CC BY 4.0) |\n|---|---|\n| **(a)** | 🟡 none in the DDC – the Zenodo workbook is the processed table |\n| **(b)** | 🟢 WGI Fig 2.4 – ice-core CO₂ / CH₄ / N₂O 0–2000 CE (`10.5285/60eeb3cc…`) · per-network means inside the Fig 2.5 file |\n| **(c)** | 🟢 WGI Fig 2.11 – AR6 four-dataset mean 1850–2020, PAGES 2k, land/ocean (`10.5285/f3515388…`) |\n| **(d)** | 🟢 WGI Fig 3.8 – lines of evidence per driver (`10.5285/bf3d0b8a…`) · Fig 7.6 ERF 1750–2019 (`10.5285/0dd364e7…`) · Fig 7.8 attributed warming by agent (`10.5285/5ef11ad1…`) |\n\nOther intermediate archives: DKRZ `IPCC-DDC_AR6_Supplements`, CSIC Atlas, figure code on github.com/IPCC-WG1.\n\n➡ **Next** – DKRZ Supplements, then CEDA.",
     "image": ""
    },
    "layerOverride": [],
    "transition": {
     "type": "smooth",
     "time": 2.0
    }
   }
  },
