  "0d945ca0-fb87-42e7-9b7d-5da2a006da8b": {
   "name": "Step 3 · CEDA Harwell – the chapter-level chain",
   "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
   "visible": true,
   "parameters": {
    "zoom": 11.5,
    "extent": [
     -178703.29552287914,
     6701843.0343899,
     -113844.32628184385,
     6745082.347217256
    ],
    "content": {
     "contentMode": "map",
     "title": "Step 3 · CEDA Harwell – the chapter-level chain",
     "markdown": "🟢 **AVAILABLE** – copy in this project, loaded live from the archive when online\n\nFour CEDA records show how inputs became the SPM numbers:\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| **Fig 2.4 (v20221219)** | ice cores → pre-1958 part of panel (b) · `fig2_4b_data_v2.csv` |\n| **Fig 2.11 (v20220510)** | four datasets → AR6 mean → panel (c) · `Figure2_11_panel_a.csv` |\n| **Fig 3.8 (v20220613)** | Ribes, Haustein, Gillett, Ch.7 estimates + 13 CMIP6 models → panel (d) · `drivers_observed_warming.csv` |\n| **Fig 7.6 → 7.8 (v20220721)** | ERF by agent → emulator → warming by agent → SPM.2(c) and panel (b) heights |\n\nCatalogue state (checked 2026-10-13): all four **citable**, DOIs resolve, CC BY 4.0.\nArchive path: `https://dap.ceda.ac.uk/badc/ar6_wg1/data/ch_0x/…` – CORS enabled, so the notebook reads them directly in the browser.\n\n➡ **Next** – Step 4: the final data.",
     "image": ""
